event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_04e457db59d99b2b016ac962b1cac08195b9a08dbf659a611e","output_index":0,"sequence_number":101,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing storage API tests**\n\nI need to create compact server storage API tests and ensure the UI is static for native node integration. I've got time to work on it, but I want to limit errors and security risks. I'm considering what modules to use for storage and whether a small server export is necessary for my application. The simplest server.js app could handle HTTP requests and its own database. I need to ensure the UI includes navigation links and correct form submissions for server validation. I'll detail this in the README test."}

event: response.reasoning_summary_part.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","item_id":"rs_04e457db59d99b2b016ac962b1cac08195b9a08dbf659a611e","output_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Implementing storage API tests**\n\nI need to create compact server storage API tests and ensure the UI is static for native node integration. I've got time to work on it, but I want to limit errors and security risks. I'm considering what modules to use for storage and whether a small server export is necessary for my application. The simplest server.js app could handle HTTP requests and its own database. I need to ensure the UI includes navigation links and correct form submissions for server validation. I'll detail this in the README test."},"sequence_number":102,"summary_index":0}

